 → curious reaction\n(starting with Image Generator 35, end with Image Upload 15)\n\nMake the reaction **humorously dramatic in a Thai TV commercial style**. The performance should feel like: **serious intense workout → exaggerated dramatic head turn → curious reaction. His eyes widen slightly and his eyebrows lift, creating a funny “What is that?” reaction. Keep the acting exaggerated but photorealistic; no cartoon expressions or animation.\n\n**CAMERA: completely locked-off and static.** No zoom, no push-in, no pull-back, no pan, no tilt, no tracking, no orbit, no handheld movement, no reframing. Keep exactly the same close-up framing throughout. **Only the man's eyes, facial expression and head move.**\n\n**Timing:**\n0–2 sec: intense workout expression, facing original direction.\n2–3 sec:  then dramatic head turn toward the frame right, eyes looks at frame right\n3–5 sec: hold the final sideways-looking reaction.\n\nNo cuts, no dialogue, no additional people. Photorealistic live-action, cinematic Thai commercial style, humorous, exaggerated acting, realistic sweat, natural tropical sunlight and believable movement.\n\n","name":"Video Generator 2","generateAudio":false,"results":[{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-23T03:53:52.170Z","runIndex":0},{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-23T04:08:50.272Z","runIndex":1},{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-23T04:17:33.887Z","runIndex":2},{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-23T04:29:10.071Z","runIndex":3},{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-23T04:32:02.954Z","runIndex":4},{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-23T05:07:11.456Z","runIndex":5}],"activeRunIndex":5,"mediaWidth":720,"mediaHeight":1280},"width":960,"height":960,"style":{"width":960,"height":960},"measured":{"width":960,"height":960},"selected":false,"dragging":false,"resizing":false},{"id":"imageGenerator-hYjwXBeoPCMqcpY_kBcDx","type":"imageGene