mportant delivery. She grips the rope tightly with both hands, leans forward and repeatedly urges the buffalo to go faster. Her expression is **extremely anxious, focused and determined**, as if she is racing against time.\n\nThe buffalo runs **powerfully and quickly toward the camera**, with realistic animal movement and believable weight. Its body bounces naturally with every stride, while its legs, horns and head move organically.\n\nWith every hoof impact, **large amounts of realistic dry dust, dirt and small gravel are kicked into the air**. Dust and dirt splash outward from the hooves and form a trailing cloud behind the buffalo. Individual particles catch the sunlight and gradually disperse naturally. Make the dust physics realistic and dynamic.\n\n**Thai TV commercial comedy style:** Present the scene like an epic, high-stakes action sequence, while the situation is absurdly funny. The woman takes the delivery extremely seriously, acting dramatically urgent, while the buffalo charges forward like a heroic racehorse. Exaggerate her facial expressions and physical reactions slightly, but keep everything **photorealistic and believable**. The humor comes from the dramatic presentation and situation, not cartoon effects.\n\n**Camera:** Dynamic cinematic tracking shot moving backward in front of the running buffalo, keeping the woman and buffalo centered. Strong sense of forward momentum with subtle natural camera shake from the running. Occasional slightly low-angle perspective to make the buffalo look dramatically powerful.\n\nBright tropical daylight, warm sunlight, rural Thai rice fields, distant green mountains, realistic atmospheric haze and cinematic dust.\n\n**Photorealistic live action, energetic Thai commercial style, exaggerated comedy, realistic animal movement and dust physics. No cartoon animation, no additional people, no cuts, no unrealistic anatomy.**\n","name":"Video Generator 3","generateAudio":true,"results":[{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":""