o table in a rice field hut. With a gentle, calm smile, she takes a red instant food packet out of her jacket pocket, places it on the table, opens it, pours steaming hot water into the open packet from a vintage metal kettle, and then pulls a spoon out to stir the food directly inside the packet.\nKey Settings & Sequence Details\nStyle: Thai comedy TV commercial style, quirky and humorous tone.\nKeyframe Sequence: 1. M1 — Pulls red packet out from pocket and sets it upright on the bamboo table.\n2. M2 — Opens packet top and pours steaming hot water into it from kettle.\n3. M3 — Pulls spoon from pocket and calmly stirs the steaming hot contents inside the packet.\nCamera: Static medium shot, smooth continuous performance with no cuts.\nAtmosphere: Sunny countryside daytime, gentle breeze in the rice field background, visible steam rising from the packet.\nNO MUSIC, Only SFX.","name":"Video Generator 6","generateAudio":false,"results":[{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-23T09:43:22.505Z","runIndex":0},{"url":"{{user-upload}}","text":"","timestamp":"2026-09-23T09:50:21.000Z","runIndex":1}],"activeRunIndex":1,"mediaWidth":560,"mediaHeight":752},"width":851,"height":960,"style":{"width":851,"height":960},"measured":{"width":851,"height":960},"selected":false,"dragging":false,"resizing":false},{"id":"videoUpload-936zXlq-359_Sm7WqDvRT","type":"videoUpload","position":{"x":-2508.080036971232,"y":6023.955639781111},"data":{"mediaUrl":"{{user-upload}}","filename":"black.mp4","mimeType":null,"uploadStatus":"completed","errorMessage":null,"duration":null,"mediaWidth":1920,"mediaHeight":1080,"imageUrl":"{{user-upload}}","name":"black"},"width":320,"height":274,"style":{"width":320,"height":274},"measured":{"width":320,"height":274},"selected":false,"dragging":false},{"id":"imageUpload-phWVcz8jBIRBdyWcz8jSJ","type":"imageUpload","position":{"x":187.41794321035053,"y":4864.574289585179},"data":{"imageUrl":"{{user-upload}}","filename":"S9.jpeg","uploadStatus":